GATE="shellcheck"
EXPECT_EXIT="2"
DESCRIPTION="A read-only report directory. mkdir -p succeeds on one that already exists, so unwritability was only discovered at write time -- after gate_error had disarmed the ERR trap, which meant errexit killed the process with the failing cat's status. Every verdict collapsed to exit 1, 'found the thing it looks for', including passes. Now proven at init before any work is done."
